    "This combination belongs to macOS (⌥⌘D shows/hides the Dock; Control-Option is VoiceOver’s).": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 改键被拒弹窗",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个组合归 macOS 所有（⌥⌘D 是系统程序坞的显隐键，⌃⌥ 是旁白的修饰键）。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This combination belongs to macOS (⌥⌘D shows/hides the Dock; Control-Option is VoiceOver’s)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這組按鍵屬於macOS（⌥⌘D用來顯示／隱藏Dock，Control-Option是旁白的修飾鍵）。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この組み合わせはmacOSが使用しています（⌥⌘DはDockの表示/非表示、Control-OptionはVoiceOverの修飾キーです）。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Kombination gehört macOS (⌥⌘D blendet das Dock ein und aus, Control-Option gehört VoiceOver)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette combinaison appartient à macOS (⌥⌘D affiche et masque le Dock ; Control-Option est réservé à VoiceOver)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta combinación es de macOS (⌥⌘D muestra y oculta el Dock; Control + Opción es de VoiceOver)."
          }
        },
        "es-419": {
          "stringUnit": {
